---
import { Image } from 'astro:assets';
import ResourcePageLayout from '../../../layouts/ResourcePageLayout.astro';
---

<ResourcePageLayout
  title="Earn Bitcoin"
  description="Ways to earn bitcoin without buying it — work, sales, and services."
  lang="en"
>
  <section class="intro">
    <p>New services and ways to earn bitcoin keep appearing. It might be as cashback on online purchases, by completing tasks, by viewing an ad, and so on.</p>

    <p>Below is a list of different ways to earn bitcoin. If you'd rather buy bitcoin, read more about where and how here: <a href="/en/get-started/buy-bitcoin">Buying bitcoin</a></p>
  </section>

  <section class="services-section">
    <div class="service-grid">
      <div class="service-card">
        <Image src="/images/logos/satsback.png" alt="Satsback" width={180} height={180} class="service-logo" />
        <h3><a href="https://satsback.com/register/6zj3laKvOmPVyKE5" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Satsback.com</a></h3>
        <p>Satsback has built a browser extension that lets you earn cashback on purchases across many thousands of websites.</p>
        <a href="https://satsback.com/register/6zj3laKvOmPVyKE5" class="service-link" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">
          Read more and sign up here →
        </a>
      </div>

      <div class="service-card">
        <Image src="/images/logos/addslice.jpeg" alt="AddSlice" width={291} height={291} class="service-logo" />
        <h3><a href="https://addslice.com/?crew=f5DzF" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">AddSlice.com</a></h3>
        <p>Slice is a browser extension that pays you satoshis for showing ads. So you earn sats just by browsing the internet.</p>
        <a href="https://addslice.com/?crew=f5DzF" class="service-link" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">
          Read more and sign up here →
        </a>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="contact-note">
    <p>Know of other services? Feel free to email <a href="mailto:kontakt@enogtyve.org">kontakt@enogtyve.org</a> or post in the <a href="http://chat.enogtyve.org" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Telegram group</a>.</p>
  </section>

  <a href="#" class="back-to-top">
    ↑ Back to top
  </a>
</ResourcePageLayout>

<style>
  .intro {
    margin-bottom: var(--space-lg);
    line-height: 1.7;
  }

  .intro p {
    margin-bottom: var(--space-md);
  }

  .services-section {
    margin: var(--space-xl) 0;
  }

  .service-grid {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(300px, 1fr));
    gap: var(--space-md);
  }

  .service-card {
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    background: var(--background-card);
    border: 2px solid var(--border);
    border-radius: 8px;
    padding: var(--space-md);
    transition: all 0.3s ease;
  }

  .service-card:hover {
    border-color: var(--primary);
    transform: translateY(-4px);
  }

  .service-card h3 {
    font-size: 1.4rem;
    margin-bottom: var(--space-sm);
  }

  .service-logo {
    height: 32px;
    max-width: 120px;
    object-fit: contain;
    object-position: left;
    margin-bottom: var(--space-sm);
  }

  .service-card h3 a:hover {
    opacity: 0.8;
  }

  .service-card p {
    color: var(--text-light);
    line-height: 1.6;
    margin-bottom: var(--space-md);
    flex: 1;
  }

  .service-link {
    display: inline-block;
    font-weight: bold;
    margin-top: auto;
    padding-top: var(--space-sm);
    transition: opacity 0.2s ease;
  }

  .service-link:hover {
    opacity: 0.7;
  }

  .contact-note {
    margin-top: 4rem;
  }

  .contact-note p {
    color: var(--text-light);
    line-height: 1.7;
  }

</style>
